        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Scandinavian Oval Cylinder for ASSA Type Locks</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese Scandinavian Oval cylinders are used on ASSA type mortise locks including mortise locks used by Anderson. For use on out side of door.\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/206S-KIDBA_size.gif?v=1704354522\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"MUL-T-LOCK High Security Rim Cylinder\"> \r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\nSupplied standard with 1 owner key card and 2 keys per cylinder. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Mul-T-Lock 206S-SCANEXT Scandinavian Oval Cylinder \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Drill and Pick Resistance Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>MUL-T-LOCK's cylindrical locks are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Saves time and money on future lock replacements or re-keying when employes leave.  Remove the worry about anyone make duplicates of your keys. <b>Keep your doors safe!</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIf ordering multiple locks you can have them Key Alike (use the same key) or Keyed Different (different keys for each lock). You can also order <a href=\"/products/cut-keys-for-mul-t-lock-locksets-and-padlocks\">Extra Keys Cut</a> below if more than 2 are required.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Note:</b> This item is normally <b>special order.</b> Please allow <b>4 weeks</b> to ship.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Scandinavian Oval Cylinder for ASSA Type Locks, Mul-T-Lock 206S-SCANEXT",
